unications Server for any NEW Updates! 💬\nPlease LIKE and FAVORITE the Game! 👍\n\nDEVELOPMENT TEAM:\n- @monkeyboy4476 (Project Lead)\n- @RT_Adam55 (Scripter)\n- @610super (Modeler, Builder, Music Composer, GFX Artist, VFX Artist)\n- @zomb1eghe (UI Designer)\n\nInspired By: Flee The Facility, Forsaken, Untitled Tag Game, Evade","path":"/game/133281939656436-diokophobia","slug":"133281939656436-diokophobia","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/c69529c948a18d0a90af9699b623d47573ac2bdb6914eae49015a66f9f69452b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d942f713b3a570d745333a1c297a008d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":10344198,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-13T03:18:36.584Z","creator":{"name":"OHWORD","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":133627020051654,"name":"Punch Wall","desc":"How many walls can you punch?🚪\n\n🥊 UPGRADE GLOVES – Build your body as a strongman!\n💥 SMASH & RELAX – Destroy walls for satisfying rewards!\n🌎 UNLOCK WORLDS – Rebirth and break through new worlds!\n🐕️ UNIQUE PETS - Get your own pet to gain generous bonuses!\n\n🔓 Code: NEW, 100liKES, 1K_LiKes, 5K_lIKes, 12K_LiKes, k25lIKES, 50liKeS_k\nNext Code at 120k likes!\n\n⭐Like & Favorite for FREE CODE!\n\n🏷️ Tags:\nDestruction, Progression, Unlockables, Grinding, Rebirth, Pets, Gachapon, Idle, Satisfaction, Punch Doors, Punch Wall","path":"/game/133627020051654-punch-wall","slug":"133627020051654-punch-wall","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/82e9f6d7f78d29c58b6bc50cf12476c0103d3125b61f558de87e0c7a3ac81e81.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fcf09e1fe6a3039392cad27650c4b8b0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":81557960,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T18:00:36.091Z","creator":{"name":"Wuxus Punchman","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14119,"totalPages":589,"currentPage":355}